0..71 Comment "//! A case that tells the two orders of two arguments apart is refused."
72..75 Comment "//!"
76..150 Comment "//! Two beacons side by side are one term in their two orders. A case that"
151..220 Comment "//! answers with the left beacon gives two answers for that one term."
221..224 Comment "//!"
225..303 Comment "//! The checker and the kernel each search the two pairings of two fields. The"
304..380 Comment "//! search joins no two answers that the symmetry does not join, so the case"
381..399 Comment "//! stays refused."
400..403 Comment "//!"
404..420 Comment "//! - see: #8385"
422..452 Comment "// `Beacon` with its symmetry."
